Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:36.73,Title,0,0,0,0,,《疯狂的麦克斯2》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:02.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（油量）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:10.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小心）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:01.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地球）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:27.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（肉和青菜）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.38,1:05:44.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（二氧化氮）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命在凋逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life fades…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,视线渐渐模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the vision dims.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的只有回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that remains are memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.67,0:01:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得 混乱的时光…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember a time of chaos…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁去的梦想 这片被糟蹋的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ruined dreams, this wasted land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一切之中 我记得的是公路战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most of all, I remember the Road Warrior…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫他麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the man we called Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.27,0:02:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要了解他是谁 必须回到另一个时代…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To understand who he was, you have to go back to another time…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.90,0:02:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当世界仍以黑色燃油作为能量来源…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when the world was powered by the black fuel…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙漠里出现了有着钢铁和管线的大城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the deserts sprouted great cities of pipe and steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都没了 消失的一干二净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone now, swept away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了早被忘掉的原因 两个强大的战士部落发生战争…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For reasons long forgotten, two mighty warrior tribes went to war…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,触发了一场大火 吞噬了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and touched off a blaze which engulfed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了燃料 他们什么都不是了 用稻草盖了房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without fuel they were nothing. They'd built a house of straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷声隆隆的机器 发出劈拍声后停了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thundering machines sputtered and stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的领导人谈了又谈… 又再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their leaders talked and talked and talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有什么能阻止崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing could stem the avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的世界瓦解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their world crumbled…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市被炸毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the cities exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,掠夺的旋风…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whirlwind of looting…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.33,0:02:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧的火灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a firestorm of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,人开始吃人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men began to feed on men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路上到处是白色恐怖的梦魇\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the roads, it was a white-line nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有行动力够到处觅食的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only those mobile enough to scavenge…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,残忍得能掠夺的 才活得下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…brutal enough to pillage, would survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮派接管了高速公路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gangs took over the highways…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了一箱橘子汁准备发动战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ready to wage war for a tank of juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这样衰退的大混乱里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in this maelstrom of decay…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通人会被撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ordinary men were battered and smashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,像麦克斯这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men like Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,战士麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The warrior Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在引擎的怒吼声里 他失去了一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the roar of an engine, he lost everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了只剩空壳的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and became a shell of a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个累坏而寂寞的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A burnt-out, desolate man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去被恶魔追逐的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man haunted by the demons of his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位流荡到荒漠里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who wandered out into the wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was here…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个枯竭之地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in this blighted place…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他学着重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that he learned to live again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤了那蛇 放下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt the snake. Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻轻地 好好地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gently, gently. Nice. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在放下铁棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下 转过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down, down. Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我找到了些汽油 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like I got myself some gasoline, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？V8的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh? V8? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷阱设好了 碰一下这些罐子就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Booby-trapped. Touch those tanks and:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷阱 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Booby trap. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你个狡猾的小子 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you crafty little man, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应很快 非常快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're quick, very quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.76,0:11:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没看过有人比蛇还快的 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen a man beat the snake before. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,生理反射作用 那是你拥有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reflexes. Yeah. That's what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我有头脑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I got brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个反应快的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fella, a quick fella…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会藏武器在那下面 必须把他的头给顶着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…might have a weapon under there. I'd have to pin his head to the panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别当我是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't play me the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽油 燃料 汽油 有好几千加仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas, fuel, gasoline! Thousands of gallons of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要多少有多少 - 在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As much as you want! - Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这二十英里的地方 他们在挖油 炼油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty miles from here. Pumping it, they are. Refining!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 满满一油槽 - 胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A huge tanker full. - Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不… 是真的 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no, it's true! It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是自助式的 不 不 对我来说太难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not self-service, no, no. It's too hard for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.21,0:12:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但像你这样聪明灵巧的人… - 在哪里？哪儿…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But a man of your ingenuity… - Where? Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我你就永远不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me and you'll never find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.03,0:13:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖狗 乖狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good dog. Nice doggy, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good doggy…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝褔你 狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you, dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… 在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里待了四天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four days I was up here…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和蛇儿们打麻将喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}…me and the snakes, playing mahjong, taking tea…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着 想着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…watching, thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么进去弄到汽油？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how was I gonna get in and get the gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,日夜不停地抽取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day and night it's pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,能烧的燃油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel to burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么都有 电力 灯 你想得到的都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got the lot. Power, lights, you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌你的头他们会死守住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can bet your life they mean to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有30个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty of them in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,弓箭 火炮 枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrows, flamethrowers, guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不适人类或爬虫居住\N{\fnArial\fs30}No place for man or reptile, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后这个垃圾来了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this trash arrived…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,像飞峨扑火一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as moths to a flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍 攻击 攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Round and round, attack, attack…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.33,0:14:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,像生气的蚂蚁 闻到汽油就发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like angry ants, mad with the smell of gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们贮油的地方… 在油槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the tanker, that's where they keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上万加仑 要多少有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of gallons. As much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人能进去 就是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone's gonna get in there, it's gonna be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢 我得去喂蛇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I'm gonna feed the snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想一个人得信守诺言 我讲信用了 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man lives by his word, I reckon, and I've kept mine, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们协定好了 我带你找到汽油 你让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we had a deal. I show you the gas and you let me go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 原先的安排是我不杀你 - 我为你做了这些之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The arrangement was I wouldn't kill you. - After all I've clone for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你很划算啊 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reckon you got a bargain, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击 害虫们 攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack, my vermin, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进 给我抢燃料 为了荷蒙格斯的荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onward! Bring me the fuel. For the glory of Humungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了伟大荷蒙格斯的荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the great glory of Humungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混蛋向左边疯去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smegma crazies to the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门… 变态的狂暴武士们到大门去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gate! Gayboy berserkers to the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.81,0:24:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.98,0:24:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了汽油来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just here for the gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.15,0:24:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你高兴要多少都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.11,0:24:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要带我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.00,0:25:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起武器站出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show your weapons and come forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.88,0:25:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.30,0:25:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it real easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.51,0:25:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,走到那里就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's as far as you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.14,0:25:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳森 纳森 是纳森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan! Nathan! It's Nathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.64,0:25:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 拿担架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, get the stretcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.10,0:25:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.61,0:25:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,开大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.28,0:25:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿担架来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up with that damned stretcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.07,0:25:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.28,0:25:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 没事 就待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's fine. It's fine. Just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好他 看好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover him. Cover him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, quick. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.67,0:26:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 太糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.42,0:26:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心他的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch his leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.09,0:26:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你都干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your handiwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.30,0:26:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一点机会都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.26,0:26:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过他 你们都听到了 我说“太疯狂了”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I warned him. You all heard me."Madness, " I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.23,0:26:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说「我们可以带着我们的汽油逃」，我说「怎么逃？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We can escape, take our gas" he said."How?" I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.77,0:26:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那机器弄进去 查利 来帮我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that machine inside. Charlie, help me…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.06,0:26:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,德芮克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Derek?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.82,0:26:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 把他放在桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, put him on the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.95,0:26:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把机器拖进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that machine inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.28,0:26:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,关大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the damned gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.04,0:26:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 借过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your backs, mind your backs. Corning through.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.63,0:26:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 给他一些空间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give him room, give him room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.56,0:26:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.02,0:27:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么过来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get through out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.31,0:27:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要答案 你在哪里找到他的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I want some answers. Where did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.65,0:27:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面两三英里的地方 因为死了被留下的 我们有个协定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two or three miles down the road, left for dead. We had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.15,0:27:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有另外三台车 有看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were three other vehicles. Did you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.61,0:27:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们急急忙忙一直向西南开去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading to the southwest in heaps of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.16,0:27:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说如果我带他回来 你们会给我一些汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said if I brought him back, you'd give me some gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.82,0:27:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在没那么多闲功夫 - 车里有一个女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, there's not much time. - There was a woman in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.08,0:27:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.17,0:27:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.54,0:27:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生得很快 我只要我的汽油 想离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was quick. I just want my gas, I wanna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.45,0:27:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能是他们之一 什么都别给\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all we know, he's one of them. Give him nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.05,0:27:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是对的 他是寄生虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right, he's a parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.88,0:27:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,以人肉交易 魔鬼败类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trading in human flesh. Mercenary trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.93,0:27:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有协定 - 什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We had an arrangement. - What do you mean, an arrangement?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.10,0:27:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去和他谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk to this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.64,0:27:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 试试什么 试点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Try something. Try something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.45,0:28:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有合约 是和他订的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had a contract, it was with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.33,0:28:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也和他一起死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it died With him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他赶走 - 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get rid of him. - Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.54,0:28:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.34,0:28:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.34,0:28:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是宝物一件 最后一个V8拦截者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta hand it to you, treasure. The last of the V8 Interceptors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.80,0:28:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}A piece of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.14,0:28:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它炸掉真是一个耻辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have been a shame to blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.86,0:28:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.03,0:28:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上大门 他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come! Close the gates! They're coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.40,0:29:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开火 他没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire! He comes in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.90,0:29:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝 别开火 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For Christ's sake, hold your fire! - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.28,0:30:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.67,0:30:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 别开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Christ's sake, hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.21,0:30:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自荷蒙格斯的问候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings from the Humungus!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.21,0:30:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷蒙格斯大帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord Humungus!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.63,0:31:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,荒地的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Warrior of the Wasteland!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.51,0:31:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇滚乐的阿亚图拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ayatollah of Rock 'n' Roll-ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.89,0:31:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gravely disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们再一次让我启动战事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again you have made me unleash my dogs of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.57,0:31:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看你们… - 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at what remains… - Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.57,0:31:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 勇猛的侦察兵都剩些什么 - 杀了他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …of your gallant scouts. - Kill him now…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.74,0:31:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？因为你们自私 - 一旦找到有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? Because you're selfish. - …while you've got the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们死藏着你们的汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hoard your gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.58,0:31:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们不讲道理 - 别听他讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You will not listen to reason. - Don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.49,0:31:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我的囚犯说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, my prisoners say…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.83,0:31:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们计划把汽油移出荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you plan to take your gasoline out of the wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.58,0:31:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早你们派他们出去找车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent them out this morning to find a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.50,0:31:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,找一台够大的车来拖那个肥油库\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rig big enough to haul that fat tank of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.59,0:31:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么卑鄙的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a puny plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.89,0:31:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看看四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.68,0:31:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是死亡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Valley of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.23,0:31:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.02,0:31:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也逃不出去 荷蒙格斯统的治荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can escape! The Humungus rules the wasteland!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.11,0:32:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不要给他们 炸掉它 什么都不要给…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them nothing. Blow it up. Give them…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.07,0:32:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷蒙格斯没那么好惹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humungus will not be defied.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.68,0:32:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,魏兹 魏兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wez. Wez.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.97,0:32:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听好了 - 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to me! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.36,0:32:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.37,0:32:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.62,0:32:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 安静 别再玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet. Quiet. No more games.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.88,0:33:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more games!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.13,0:33:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是有目的而来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here for a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.51,0:33:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个提案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come with an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.85,0:33:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不必再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No more talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.39,0:33:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去 我们杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in. We kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.85,0:33:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.69,0:33:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀他们 杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll kill them! Kill them. Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.36,0:33:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见他了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.20,0:33:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill! Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.25,0:33:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动 我的战狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be still, my dog of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.42,0:33:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.63,0:33:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都失去过心爱的人 但我们照我的方法做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all lost someone we love. But we do it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.71,0:33:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,输家才会等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losers. Losers wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.88,0:33:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们照我的方法做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.05,0:33:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧是我们的同盟 汽油会是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their fear is our ally. The gasoline will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.43,0:33:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你可以复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you shall have your revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.62,0:34:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有太多的暴力 太多痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been too much violence, too much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.25,0:34:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿一切都有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}None here are without sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.67,0:34:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有一个真诚的和解方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have an honorable compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.76,0:34:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.93,0:34:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把泵…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the pump…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.97,0:34:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,原油…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the oil…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.89,0:34:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽油…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the gasoline…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.85,0:34:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和整个营区都给我 我就饶了你们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the whole compound, and I'll spare your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.10,0:34:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这儿 我会让你们安全的通过荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk away. I will give you safe passage in the wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.11,0:34:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要离开 恐惧就能结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk away and there will be an end to the horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.29,0:34:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等你们的回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}I await your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.50,0:35:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有一整天来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one full day to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.32,0:35:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never walk away!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.49,0:35:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.30,0:35:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到他说的话了 听来很合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard what he said. It sounds reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.97,0:36:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不必死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.68,0:36:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to do is walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.06,0:36:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们苦心经营这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We've worked too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.56,0:36:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 我们只要用燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's simple. All we do is change the fuel…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.98,0:36:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这个废车场来换我们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and this junkyard for our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.82,0:36:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们欲擒故纵 想把我们像杀猪般宰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if we walk out there, they'll slaughter us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会放开我们 然后向杀猪一般地砍了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll set us loose and then cut us down like pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.74,0:36:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他们的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.28,0:36:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.08,0:36:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和这个荷蒙格斯谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk to this Humungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.87,0:36:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个明事理的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a reasonable man…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.75,0:36:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意接受谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}…open to negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.17,0:36:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他答应给我们一条生路 他承诺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He promised us safe passage. He gave his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.34,0:36:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们假设他守信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let us suppose he keeps it…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.22,0:36:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以保住性命离开这里 然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we walk away from here with our lives. What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.08,0:37:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}But remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.75,0:37:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住一件事 比一槽油更重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember one thing. That is more than just a tanker of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.55,0:37:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们能在 机器害虫之外生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is our lifeline to a place beyond that vermin on machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.63,0:37:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是离这儿两千英里以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 2000 miles from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.59,0:38:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我们要怎么到达那儿？用拖的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you expect us to get it there? Drag it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.85,0:38:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果必须如此 是的 总有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we have to, yes. There's always a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.64,0:38:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但第一步是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the first step…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.40,0:38:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}…defend the fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.23,0:38:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,空话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.15,0:38:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是空话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just words!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.19,0:38:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会为了白日梦死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd die for a pipe dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.99,0:38:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了 我们为了信仰而战 我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong. We fight for a belief. I stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.96,0:38:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能成功 帕帕盖洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it could have worked, Pappagallo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.50,0:38:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能要我们和那些人对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't expect to compete with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.34,0:38:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一天比一天弱 他们一天比一天强 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day we get weaker while they get stronger. It's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.51,0:38:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.18,0:38:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前 我看到一台能拖动那只油槽的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago I saw a vehicle that'd haul that tanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.40,0:38:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想离开这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get out of here…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.23,0:38:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.03,0:39:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这是我的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so that's my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.37,0:39:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责一台够大能拖动油槽的车…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deliver a rig big enough to haul that tanker…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.79,0:39:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把我的车还我 以及我能带得动的汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you give me back my vehicle and as much juice as I can carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.37,0:39:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今早失去了8个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost eight good people this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.05,0:39:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在想什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he got in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.46,0:39:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要5加仑柴油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, to do the job I need five gallons of diesel…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.72,0:39:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一些高能量的汽油来办这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and some high-octane gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.35,0:39:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当作是预付款吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it as a down payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.56,0:39:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是最后一次看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the last we'll ever see of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.23,0:39:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来拿他的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to come back for his wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.81,0:39:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能损失什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we got to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.90,0:39:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got yourself a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.39,0:40:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车和我能载得动的油\N{\fnArial\fs30}My vehicle and all the juice I can carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.32,0:41:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.11,0:41:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.82,0:43:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最怀念什么吗？干净的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I miss most of all? Clean women.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.04,0:44:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,指甲油 香水…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nail polish, perfume…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.50,0:44:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚踏车坐垫的味道 鸡尾酒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the smell of bicycle seats, cocktails…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.00,0:44:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 甜点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - Desserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.55,0:44:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,内衣 记得内衣吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lingerie. Remember lingerie?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.14,0:44:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 我知道会有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. I knew it'd work.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.81,0:44:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要命 这些蛇 天生的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lethal. Lethal, these snakes. Born killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.53,0:44:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.70,0:44:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的蛇 我训练出来的 让我吃掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my snake. I trained it. I'm gonna eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.16,0:44:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找你自己的 放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So find your own. Get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.95,0:44:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有煮蛇的食谱 很美味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a recipe for snake. Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.71,0:44:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬虫炖肉丁 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fricassee of reptile. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.75,0:44:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你的狗食好 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than your dog food. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.71,0:44:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯蛋白质 矿物质 维他命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure protein, minerals, vitamins.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.59,0:44:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,人一定要照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man's gotta look after himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.34,0:44:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,健康的心灵 健康的身体 狗儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Healthy mind, healthy body, dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.93,0:45:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃什么就成为什么 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! You are what you eat, I reckon. Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.73,0:45:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个该照照镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two ought to take a look in the mirror some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.73,0:45:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没品味 没水准\N{\fnArial\fs30}No style, no taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.90,0:45:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empty…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.90,0:45:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞了半天\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.91,0:45:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不诚实 下流\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's dishonest. Low.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.17,0:45:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你那台车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a look at this machine of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.59,0:45:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道那是不是坏的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know that one's not a dud?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.71,0:45:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来看看 - 没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find out. - Cool. Cool, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.76,0:45:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须了解基本的空气动力学 像这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you've gotta understand the basics of aerodynamics in a thing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.60,0:45:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.97,0:46:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.31,0:46:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我呢？你不会把我留下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me, eh? You're not gonna leave me here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.86,0:46:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱干嘛干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.49,0:46:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.70,0:46:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 我们是伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, we're partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.71,0:46:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partners!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.57,0:48:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.24,0:50:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呜 - 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoo! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.53,0:51:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的狗儿 跑 大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dogs, run. The gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.87,0:51:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门 大门 打开大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gate. The gate. The gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.21,0:53:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你能跑 但你躲不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. You can run, but you can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.90,0:53:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.45,0:53:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.70,0:53:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.41,0:53:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go overboard now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.54,0:53:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要碰 拜托 这东西很宝贝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't touch, please. It's a precision instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.50,0:53:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.92,0:53:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, ah, ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.80,0:54:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.55,0:54:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoo, shoo. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.43,0:54:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去 去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoo! Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.10,0:54:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.52,0:54:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你这台机器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, son, this machine of yours…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.61,0:54:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以载两个人吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it can take two, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.74,0:54:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.29,0:54:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.58,0:54:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 把大家组织起来 我们今晚走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Just get them organized, we're moving out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.21,0:54:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 大家听着 我们今晚出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen, everyone. We're going out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.63,0:54:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都知道该做什么 照计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know what to do, just get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.18,0:54:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,提波 德芮克 帕帕盖洛受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timbo, Derek, Pappagallo's been hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.31,0:54:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the rig?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.98,0:54:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子 车子怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rig. How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.81,0:54:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖子裂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cracked timing case cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.31,0:54:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏了齿轮上的两个齿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's broken some teeth off the timing gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.48,0:54:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖子有裂痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a cracked timing case cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.53,0:54:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,齿轮掉了两个齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's broken a couple of teeth off the timing gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.03,0:55:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷却器核心受损 - 冷却器核心受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The radiator's damaged at the core. - The radiator's damaged at the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.57,0:55:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 水箱裂了 - 水箱出现一条断裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A cracked water pump. - It's got a cracked water pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.33,0:55:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有裂开的注油器线 - 还有裂开的注油器线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And a fractured injector line. - And it's got a fractured injector line.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.87,0:55:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这些意味着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what does all that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.25,0:55:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 这些意味着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, but what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.13,0:55:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 意味着什么？ - 24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that mean? - Twenty-four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.17,0:55:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.01,0:55:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有12小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.26,0:55:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们只有12小时 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've got 12. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.18,0:55:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.34,0:55:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他搬下来 快 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get him down. Quick, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.14,0:55:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原先错看你了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I was wrong about you…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.10,0:55:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.28,0:55:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.66,0:55:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没看到有人那样开车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time since I've seen driving like that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.71,0:55:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay by me, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.80,0:56:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你开那台车 我们赢定了 有你一起不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you driving that rig, we got it licked! Nice to have you aboard, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.63,0:56:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我存了很久 请你收下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been saving those. I want you to have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.39,0:56:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.44,0:56:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴和你们做生意 但我要离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a pleasure doing business with you, but I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.52,0:56:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.41,0:56:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.20,0:56:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up on the hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.41,0:56:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些混蛋要吊死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're stringing them up, the bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.04,0:56:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.42,0:56:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们违抗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have defied me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.38,0:56:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会看到 荷蒙格斯大帝的复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will know the vengeance of Lord Humungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.89,0:56:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.43,0:56:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nobody…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.52,0:56:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能活着离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nobody gets out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.36,0:57:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来帮忙我弄这些滚筒 该死的 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's supposed to be helping out with the drums? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.08,0:57:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别忘了 在我们离开之前一点也不要浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't forget, don't waste a bit before we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.17,0:58:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 抓住那些猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanna catch the pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.88,0:58:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来弄滚筒 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on with the drums, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.34,0:58:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在那儿帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody helping over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.30,0:58:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.71,0:58:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.30,0:58:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样溜开好像不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just seems really wrong, sneaking away like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.93,0:58:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.77,0:58:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你说你想来的 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said you wanted to come, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.14,0:59:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我这么说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I did, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.06,0:59:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 你被吓到了 来 那里将会是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're scared. Now, come on, it'll be much safer up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.53,0:59:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在等什么？- 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we waiting for, eh? - No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.86,0:59:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.07,0:59:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要离开这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.79,0:59:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.50,0:59:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.72,0:59:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 把它们放到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, keep it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.03,0:59:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你了 他要走了 我怎么说来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, he's leaving. What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.78,0:59:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 他要离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.12,1:00:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须长话短说 我要你开油槽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't have time for long speeches. I want you to drive the tanker.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.29,1:00:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.96,1:00:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有约定 我做到了我的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a contract. I kept my part of the bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.22,1:00:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以订新合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make a new contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.01,1:00:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要的都在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got all I need here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.27,1:00:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有未来 我可以提供你一个未来 重建我们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a future. I could offer you that. Rebuild our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.64,1:00:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.94,1:00:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,买一张二千英里的票\N{\fnArial\fs30}…buy a ticket for 2000 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.19,1:00:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你一定要来 我们要去这儿 乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to come, sonny. This is where we're going. Paradise.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.32,1:00:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这儿二千英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two thousand miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.49,1:00:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,清新的水 阳光满天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh water, plenty of sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.45,1:00:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了养儿育女没事可做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to do but breed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.16,1:00:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.25,1:00:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事？你在找什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with you, huh? What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.92,1:00:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 每个人都在寻觅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Max, everyone's looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.34,1:00:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面很高兴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You happy out there, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.47,1:00:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,流浪？日复一日地过着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh? Wandering? One day blurring into another?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.47,1:00:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 你是腐食动物 就像蛆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a scavenger, Max. You're a maggot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.01,1:01:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.43,1:01:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你靠旧世界的死尸过活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're living off the corpse of the old world.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.69,1:01:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你的故事 说吧 告诉我你的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me your story. Come on, tell me your story.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.06,1:01:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么让你无动于衷的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What burned you out?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.73,1:01:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了太多人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill one man too many?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.40,1:01:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到太多人死？死了亲人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See too many people die? Lose some family?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.90,1:01:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此 你失去了亲人 这让你很特别？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so that's it. You lost some family. That make you something special, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.78,1:01:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.43,1:01:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是唯一受苦的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you're the only one that's suffered?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.64,1:01:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这儿都经历过这些 但我们并不放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all been through it in here. But we haven't given up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.69,1:01:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是有尊严的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still human beings with dignity.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.03,1:01:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你 你离开这里就是个垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, you're out there with the garbage.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.20,1:01:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.41,1:02:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.79,1:02:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,去 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.10,1:03:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去 出去 赶快走开 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, get out. Scat. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.30,1:03:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're letting him go?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.01,1:03:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少留住他的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's keep his vehicle, at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.14,1:03:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完成了他的约定 他是一个值得尊敬的的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fulfilled his contract. He's an honorable man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.36,1:03:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那谁来开油槽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so who's gonna drive the tanker?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.36,1:03:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.30,1:04:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看错你了 你不是懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got you wrong, you're not a coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.93,1:04:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许笨 但不是懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid maybe, but not a coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.56,1:04:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正犯一个严重的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a serious mistake…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.02,1:04:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏我们的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}…splitting a great team.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.03,1:04:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我一起 想想所有的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me together, think of the possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.94,1:04:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许会再见面 再见 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around, maybe. Goodbye, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.48,1:05:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.57,1:05:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这只小狗 你违背了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disobey me. You puppy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.01,1:06:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶蒂 汽油 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toadie, the gas. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.69,1:06:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀他 如果他还活着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't waste him. If he's alive…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.53,1:06:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I want him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.05,1:07:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,油箱是满的 伟大的魏兹 都是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tanks are full, O mighty Wez, and it's all yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.45,1:08:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.86,1:08:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.50,1:08:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 那儿 西北\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, out there. Northwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.14,1:08:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.14,1:08:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞砸了 你个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blew it, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.26,1:10:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.20,1:11:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开油槽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be driving the tanker.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.20,1:11:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会撞毁 或是撞过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna crash or crash through.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.87,1:11:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 此时 他们只想要油槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, at this point, that's all they want. The tanker.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.83,1:11:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们会直接追过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they'll come straight after us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.13,1:11:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用那个来突围…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll use that to punch our way out…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.13,1:12:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将给你们一个很好的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which will give all of you a very, very good chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.51,1:12:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.18,1:12:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你出去了 尽自己努力离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you're outside there, split up and go as hard as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.64,1:12:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,向北200英里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, 200 miles to the north…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.31,1:12:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个叫大力河的地方有座桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's a place with a bridge called Powder River.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.11,1:12:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们的集合点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.36,1:12:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到日落时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us till sunset.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.20,1:12:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果到时我们还没到… 就继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we haven't made it by then, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.66,1:12:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我够资格修理 没资格坐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good enough for me to build, but not to ride on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.99,1:12:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不准上油槽车 - 我流血流汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are not coming on this tanker! - I sweated blood on this…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.75,1:12:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没人叫我去坐校车\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and no bastard's gonna tell me to ride in no school bus!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.62,1:12:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, settle down!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.58,1:12:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果对你没差别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's all the same to you…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.38,1:12:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开油槽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'll drive that tanker.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.47,1:12:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个提议 已经没了 想订约太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The offer is closed. Too late for deals.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.93,1:12:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必订约 我想开那台车\N{\fnArial\fs30}No deals. I wanna drive that truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.56,1:12:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么突然改变心意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why the big change of heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.56,1:12:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I haven't got a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.56,1:12:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想你要怎么办到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you think you'll do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.86,1:13:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 看看你 连轮椅都开不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at you. You couldn't even drive a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.74,1:13:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯 你应该看看你自己 一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should look at yourself, Max. You're a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.24,1:13:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别再多说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.91,1:13:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你最好的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the best chance you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.59,1:13:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.16,1:14:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,移开那孩子 弄走他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move that kid! Get rid of him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.74,1:15:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.27,1:19:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.80,1:20:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.02,1:20:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开 快开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it. Move it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.64,1:21:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.92,1:21:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.96,1:23:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮胎 射轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tire! Shoot the tire!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.29,1:25:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 快 跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy! Come on, jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.79,1:25:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.79,1:25:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.67,1:25:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've won.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.55,1:25:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.61,1:27:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.66,1:27:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿子弹 子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the bullet. The bullet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.79,1:27:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.75,1:27:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿弹壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the shell.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.92,1:27:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the shell.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.46,1:27:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.18,1:31:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是开始朝北奔向安全的旅程…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so began the journey north to safety…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.18,1:31:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我们在阳光下的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to our place in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.43,1:31:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之中 找到了新领导人 从天而降的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among us we found a new leader, the man who came from the sky…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.90,1:31:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位摘罗机长\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the Gyro Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.06,1:31:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如帕帕盖洛计划的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just as Pappagallo had planned…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.52,1:31:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们远远离开了 机器害虫的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we traveled far beyond the reach of men on machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.74,1:31:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,油 宝贵的油 藏在车子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The juice, the precious juice, was hidden in the vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.45,1:31:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢 长大成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for me, I grew to manhood…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.33,1:32:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了许多时间 我成了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the fullness of time, I became the leader…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.46,1:32:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大北部落的领导人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the chief of the Great Northern Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.96,1:32:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而公路战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Road Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.67,1:32:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们最后一次见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the last we ever saw of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.22,1:32:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在活在… 我的记忆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives now only in my memories.
